
  <main id="main">

    <section class="page-head">
      <div class="container">
        <span class="eyebrow">Try what we build</span>
        <h1>These aren't screenshots. They're working examples.</h1>
        <p class="lead">Click around. Try them. Every demo below is built for a fictional South African business to show what's possible — clearly labelled as a concept, never a real client. When one looks like what you need, start a project and we'll build your version.</p>
        <p class="callout" style="max-width:52rem"><strong>Demo data only.</strong> Prices, numbers and answers are sample content for illustration. The AI assistant answers from a small set of sample documents, not a live account.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" aria-label="Interactive demos">
      <div class="container">

        <!-- DEMO 1 — quote calculator -->
        <article class="demo" id="quote-calculator">
          <div class="demo__intro reveal">
            <span class="badge badge--concept">Live demo · Custom tool</span>
            <h2>Mike's Plumbing — Quote Calculator</h2>
            <p>A customer picks a job and a few options and gets an instant estimate they can send straight to WhatsApp. No back-and-forth, no waiting. This is the kind of small custom tool that starts around R500–R2,000.</p>
            <div class="btn-row">
              <a href="start.html?type=Custom%20Tool" class="btn btn--primary">Build something similar →</a>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="demo__panel reveal">
            <div class="demo__bar"><span class="demo__dot demo__dot--r"></span><span class="demo__dot demo__dot--y"></span><span class="demo__dot demo__dot--g"></span><span class="demo__title">quote.mikesplumbing.co.za</span></div>
            <div class="demo__body">
              <label class="demo__field">Job type
                <select id="q-job">
                  <option value="450" data-min="1">Tap / mixer repair — R450</option>
                  <option value="650" data-min="1">Blocked drain — R650</option>
                  <option value="1200" data-min="2">Toilet replacement — R1,200</option>
                  <option value="2500" data-min="2">Geyser installation — R2,500</option>
                  <option value="8000" data-min="0">Bathroom renovation — from R8,000</option>
                </select>
              </label>
              <div>
                <span class="label" style="font-size:0.9rem;font-weight:600;display:block;margin-bottom:0.45rem">Add-ons</span>
                <div class="demo__opts">
                  <label><input type="checkbox" id="q-after" value="300" /> After-hours (+R300)</label>
                  <label><input type="checkbox" id="q-callout" value="150" /> Call-out fee (+R150)</label>
                  <label><input type="checkbox" id="q-parts" value="400" /> Est. parts (+R400)</label>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="demo__total"><span>Estimated total</span><b id="q-total">R450</b></div>
              <button type="button" class="btn btn--primary btn--full" id="q-wa">Copy this quote for WhatsApp</button>
              <p class="demo__note">// Demo — copies a pre-filled message you can paste into WhatsApp.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>

        <!-- DEMO 2 — sales dashboard -->
        <article class="demo" id="sales-dashboard">
          <div class="demo__intro reveal">
            <span class="badge badge--concept">Live demo · Dashboard</span>
            <h2>Example Sales Co. — Sales Dashboard</h2>
            <p>Upload a spreadsheet, see the business at a glance. Switch the period and every number and bar updates. This replaces the Friday-afternoon report someone builds by hand — dashboards start around R2,000.</p>
            <div class="btn-row">
              <a href="start.html?type=Dashboard" class="btn btn--primary">Build something similar →</a>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="demo__panel reveal">
            <div class="demo__bar"><span class="demo__dot demo__dot--r"></span><span class="demo__dot demo__dot--y"></span><span class="demo__dot demo__dot--g"></span><span class="demo__title">dashboard.examplesales.co.za</span></div>
            <div class="demo__body">
              <div class="demo__seg" id="d-seg" aria-label="Choose a period">
                <button type="button" data-p="month" class="is-active">This month</button>
                <button type="button" data-p="last">Last month</button>
                <button type="button" data-p="quarter">This quarter</button>
              </div>
              <div class="demo__tiles">
                <div class="demo__tile"><span>Revenue</span><b id="d-rev">R0</b></div>
                <div class="demo__tile"><span>Orders</span><b id="d-ord">0</b></div>
                <div class="demo__tile"><span>Avg order</span><b id="d-avg">R0</b></div>
              </div>
              <div class="demo__chartwrap" id="d-chart" aria-hidden="true"></div>
              <ul class="demo__toplist" id="d-top"></ul>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>

        <!-- DEMO 3 — AI assistant -->
        <article class="demo" id="ai-assistant">
          <div class="demo__intro reveal">
            <span class="badge badge--concept">Live demo · AI</span>
            <h2>Ask BuildRight — AI Business Assistant</h2>
            <p>An assistant that answers staff and customer questions from a company's own documents, instead of the open internet. Ask about BuildRight Contractors below. Practical AI integrations start around R3,500, plus usage.</p>
            <div class="btn-row">
              <a href="start.html?type=AI" class="btn btn--primary">Build something similar →</a>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="demo__panel reveal">
            <div class="demo__bar"><span class="demo__dot demo__dot--r"></span><span class="demo__dot demo__dot--y"></span><span class="demo__dot demo__dot--g"></span><span class="demo__title">ask.buildright.co.za</span></div>
            <div class="demo__body demo__chat">
              <div class="demo__log" id="ai-log" aria-live="polite"></div>
              <div class="demo__suggest" id="ai-suggest">
                <button type="button">What are your working hours?</button>
                <button type="button">Do you offer a guarantee?</button>
                <button type="button">What areas do you cover?</button>
                <button type="button">How do I request a quote?</button>
              </div>
              <form class="demo__ask" id="ai-form">
                <input type="text" id="ai-input" placeholder="Ask about BuildRight…" aria-label="Ask a question" />
                <button type="submit" class="btn btn--primary">Ask</button>
              </form>
              <p class="demo__note">// Demo — answers come from a small set of sample documents, not a live AI account.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>

        <!-- DEMO 4 — booking -->
        <article class="demo" id="booking">
          <div class="demo__intro reveal">
            <span class="badge badge--concept">Live demo · Custom tool</span>
            <h2>Bella Hair Studio — Online Booking</h2>
            <p>Customers pick a service, a day and an open time, and book themselves in — no phone tag, no double-bookings. It turns a website into something that saves you time. Booking tools start around R1,500.</p>
            <div class="btn-row">
              <a href="start.html?type=Custom%20Tool" class="btn btn--primary">Build something similar →</a>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="demo__panel reveal">
            <div class="demo__bar"><span class="demo__dot demo__dot--r"></span><span class="demo__dot demo__dot--y"></span><span class="demo__dot demo__dot--g"></span><span class="demo__title">book.bellahair.co.za</span></div>
            <div class="demo__body">
              <label class="demo__field">Service
                <select id="b-service">
                  <option value="280" data-name="Cut &amp; style">Cut &amp; style — R280 · 45 min</option>
                  <option value="650" data-name="Colour">Colour — R650 · 2 hr</option>
                  <option value="180" data-name="Blow wave">Blow wave — R180 · 30 min</option>
                  <option value="320" data-name="Treatment">Treatment — R320 · 45 min</option>
                </select>
              </label>
              <div>
                <span class="label" style="font-size:0.9rem;font-weight:600;display:block;margin-bottom:0.45rem">Choose a day</span>
                <div class="demo__seg demo__seg--wrap" id="b-days" aria-label="Choose a day"></div>
              </div>
              <div>
                <span class="label" style="font-size:0.9rem;font-weight:600;display:block;margin-bottom:0.45rem">Available times</span>
                <div class="demo__slots" id="b-slots"></div>
              </div>
              <div class="demo__total"><span>Your booking</span><b id="b-summary" style="font-size:1rem">Pick a time</b></div>
              <button type="button" class="btn btn--primary btn--full" id="b-confirm" disabled>Confirm booking</button>
              <p class="demo__note">// Demo — a real booking sends an SMS/WhatsApp confirmation and blocks that slot.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>

        <!-- DEMO 5 — instant quote / invoice generator -->
        <article class="demo" id="invoice">
          <div class="demo__intro reveal">
            <span class="badge badge--concept">Live demo · Automation</span>
            <h2>Nomsa's Cleaning Services — Instant Quote</h2>
            <p>Tick the services, set how often, and an itemised quote builds itself — VAT and totals worked out, ready to send. The kind of document generation that stops you rewriting the same quote every week. From around R2,000.</p>
            <div class="btn-row">
              <a href="start.html?type=Automation" class="btn btn--primary">Build something similar →</a>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="demo__panel reveal">
            <div class="demo__bar"><span class="demo__dot demo__dot--r"></span><span class="demo__dot demo__dot--y"></span><span class="demo__dot demo__dot--g"></span><span class="demo__title">quote.nomsaclean.co.za</span></div>
            <div class="demo__body">
              <div>
                <span class="label" style="font-size:0.9rem;font-weight:600;display:block;margin-bottom:0.45rem">Services</span>
                <div class="demo__opts" id="inv-opts">
                  <label><input type="checkbox" value="350" data-name="Standard clean" checked /> Standard clean · R350</label>
                  <label><input type="checkbox" value="850" data-name="Deep clean" /> Deep clean · R850</label>
                  <label><input type="checkbox" value="280" data-name="Windows" /> Windows · R280</label>
                  <label><input type="checkbox" value="200" data-name="Ironing" /> Ironing · R200</label>
                  <label><input type="checkbox" value="450" data-name="Carpet clean" /> Carpet · R450</label>
                </div>
              </div>
              <label class="demo__field">Visits per month
                <select id="inv-visits">
                  <option value="1">Once a month</option>
                  <option value="2">Twice a month</option>
                  <option value="4" selected>Weekly (4)</option>
                </select>
              </label>
              <div class="demo__invoice">
                <div class="demo__invoice-head">
                  <strong>Nomsa's Cleaning Services</strong>
                  <span class="demo__invoice-no" id="inv-no">INV-2026-014</span>
                </div>
                <div class="demo__invoice-date"><span id="inv-date"></span><span>Monthly service</span></div>
                <ul class="demo__toplist" id="inv-lines"></ul>
                <div class="demo__invoice-sub"><span>Subtotal</span><b id="inv-sub">R0</b></div>
                <div class="demo__invoice-sub"><span>VAT (15%)</span><b id="inv-vat">R0</b></div>
              </div>
              <div class="demo__total"><span>Total / month</span><b id="inv-total">R0</b></div>
              <button type="button" class="btn btn--primary btn--full" id="inv-copy">Copy quote</button>
              <p class="demo__note">// Demo — a real build emails a PDF and logs the quote automatically.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>

      </div>
    </section>

